Z||000004||NOS3800||10-03-2001||06:10 PM||||I just want to say congrats to 1FST2M6. For one I believe it shows that NOS is a legitament performance component. It shouldn't be viewed as CHEATING anymore. Its just a fact that the majority of the "fastest" cars out there spray. I think it should be viewed on the same lines of a turbo and SC. Anyway, my brother and I are hot on your tail. HIs SC3800 has run 13.2's and he just got  a smaller pulley that will increase boost.<BR>I am working on my jetting to improve my beat 13.4. I don't believe I will get a twelve, but should be closer! Congrats again!<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.45@101.12 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SIDE_SHOT_Bill.jpg"> ||||reg||10
