Z||000008||1FST2M6||10-04-2001||08:48 AM||||-nos3800- find a dyno near you and runit on there... thats how we ran my car.. dyno -jet change -dyno- jet change- etc...etc...  runit till your detonating then step on jet back. since your running a zex kit fuel enrichment really isn't there so your kinda limited to probly a 42n2o or maybe a 46... my 52 pulls killer is rich off icdle and stupid rich above 3500... time for a 2nd stage.  ||||reg||1
